  "comment": "Erlangs and Lines Calculator By using Erlangs and Lines Calculator, you can obtain the number of Busy Hour Traffic (BHT) of a number of lines. In our example, we simulate 2, 4 and 8 voice paths facilitated by 64 Kbps connectivity with some Blocking values. The calculation result can be seen at the following table: Voice Path Blocking BHT (Erlangs) 2 0.01 0.15 2 0.03 0.25 2 0.10 0.55 4 0.01 0.85 8",
